headers {
  accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # WhatsApp CRM API

  Every request in this collection uses `{{base_url}}` from the selected
  environment and spells out the `/v1` prefix itself, matching how the web app
  builds URLs from `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`.

  Pick an environment in the top right before sending anything:
  local points at the dev server on port 4000, production at Railway.
}
